  "description": "A young gangster, \"Ryong Seok-Beom,\" a low-ranking member of the Baekma gang... dares to admire his older brother, \"Ju Chul\"! This young man, brimming with youthful passion, finds his older brother, a daunting prospect...\n\nThis is the story of a bold man's unrequited love, staring down a tree he can't climb. Mysterious tarot cards! Tell me my fate!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Hachankong Danpyeonseon (하찮공 단편선) Collection.*",
